      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=17)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=3)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-4,label=-4,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=8)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 13  
      **Languages** -  
      **Challenge** 1 (200 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Traits

      ***Pack Tactics.*** The lion has ***Advantage*** on an attack roll against a creature if at least one of the lion's allies is within 5 feet of the creature and the ally doesn't have the ***Incapacitated*** condition.

      ***Running Leap.*** With a 10-foot running start, the lion can ***Long Jump*** up to 25 feet.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The lion makes two Rend attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Roar.

      ***Rend.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Rend]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d8+3,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Slashing damage.

      ***Roar.*** *Wisdom Saving Throw:* DC 11, one creature within 15 feet. *Failure:* The target has the ***Frightened*** condition until the start of the lion's next turn.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
